From: Marko Ivankovic <marko@ivankovic.me>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 10:11:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: ask before a new game discards a saved one

Starting a local or bot game from the menu, or pressing r mid-game,
silently deleted that mode's resume save. Both now ask first when a save
exists: y starts the new game, n or Esc cancels, and from the menu r
resumes the saved game instead. Enter doesn't confirm, since Enter is what
submitted the form. A game with no move played yet, or a finished one, has
no save and restarts at once.

